{"job_id":"F-32c0904990647e15cfa7","family_id":"F-32c0904990647e15cfa7","title":"중국 및 호주산 수산화알루미늄에 대한 덤핑방지관세 부과에 관한 규칙","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014435-259379-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":37,"target_id":"319b913427422b8ab7987fd5e9a1fdab323be8fe129dbd8b8fd5a9da2db6820d","source_hash":"8a7da6ac4f11fdd35b8fe61e7d10000a71c46109abbe2ee49ba691553f69a25c","text":"关于对中国和澳大利亚产氢氧化铝征收反倾销税的规则"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014435-259379-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":86,"target_id":"46cccf20880b81f9a69edf588204eb3cf25168b54722db68235d80172b892be8","source_hash":"1a2180cc6d0a23473176e09b095aee2b985442fe6d501f1561d90af9fc54684e","text":"第一条（目的）本规则的目的是根据《海关法》第五十一条指定应缴纳反倾销税的商品和供应商，并规定适用于该等商品的关税税率。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014435-259379-ko","scope":"BODY","start":86,"end":304,"target_id":"a14d502bf34bbd037f5816ff032df988fa70aaf0aba5880ef48ea6774e9284c2","source_hash":"a95b1c71f6fcbd1e35a5948644a7fac141644e5a06e82c059a4fe8007d475520","text":"第二条（征税对象） 征反倾销税的货物为产自中国和澳大利亚的氢氧化铝（指根据《海关法实施令》第九十八条第一款规定，海关和统计协调制度税号2818.30.9000所对应的货物），其为白色粉末状氢氧化铝，化学式为Al(OH)₃，平均粒径（Dp50）为55μm以上。但附件一所列货物除外。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014435-259379-ko","scope":"BODY","start":304,"end":381,"target_id":"0fbdc1674b8d243e7217d7b4e688b7fbfb4975527aedfae88b5afef1ad9fa5aa","source_hash":"8d5337d71b318f506644d5c654179168f2e06d4aa8fe88177518c16b22b089cb","text":"第3条（受征税货物的供应商和反倾销税税率）根据第2条规定受征税货物的供应商以及各供应商的反倾销税税率如附表2所示。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014435-259379-ko","scope":"BODY","start":381,"end":403,"target_id":"a7dde4080120d801ee7db82e346743209e0b853bb4f15903d1938050347d629e","source_hash":"a76b48d7354a384df88a64efc9754b61fcead6b2fc9a2006ab69a97b54f21cba","text":"补充规定 <第990号，2023年4月28日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-014435-259379-ko","scope":"BODY","start":403,"end":433,"target_id":"c58c1cfcd917cc8cc34c4921cecae72f47a4efc62722eab1b4d8